      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 12,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "痛い思いをさせてごめんなさい",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I'm sorry I had to hurt you."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ザスキア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Saskia"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 13,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "でも、あなたに反省してもらうためなの",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "But you need to learn your lesson."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ザスキア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Saskia"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 14,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "く……っ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Nngh...!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 15,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "レスナ？\u3000来たわよ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna? I'm here!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヴァレリア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Valeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 16,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "レスナ……？\u3000どうしたの？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna...? What's wrong?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヴァレリア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Valeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 17,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "あんた……誰？\u3000この子に何をしたの？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Who... are you? What did you do to her?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヴァレリア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Valeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 18,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "――答えなさいっ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "—Answer me!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヴァレリア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Valeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 19,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "おっとっと……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Oho..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ザスキア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Saskia"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 20,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "こほっ……こほ……ヴァレリア……！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "*cough* *cough* Valeria...!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 21,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "レスナ、下がってて！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Stay back, Resna!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヴァレリア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Valeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 22,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ちょうどよかったわ、ナナ。レスナを拘束しなさい",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Perfect timing, Nana. Restrain Resna."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ザスキア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Saskia"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 23,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "何を言ってるの？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "What are you talking about?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヴァレリア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Valeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 24,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "どうしてあんたの言うことなんか聞かないといけないの",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Why should I listen to anything you say?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヴァレリア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Valeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 25,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ヴァレリア……！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Valeria...!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 26,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "――そう。やはり、こちらの命令を受け付けないよう",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "—I see. So you've made sure she won't respond to our commands."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ザスキア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Saskia"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 27,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "処置を施したのね。ふふ、やるわね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Well done!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ザスキア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Saskia"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 28,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ヴァレリアが望んだことです。私は応えただけ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "This is what Valeria wanted. I just helped make it happen."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 29,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "えっ！\u3000かっこいい！\u3000どうやったの？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Wow! That's amazing! How did you do it?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヴァレリア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Valeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 30,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ヴァレリアもできるよ。同じ石を持ってるよね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "You can do it too, Valeria. You have the same stone, right?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 31,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "それをこうやって――",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Just use it like this—"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 32,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "こんな力が、私に……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I have this kind of power..."
        }
